::JOUR_U02_L07_GP_Q01::[MLA.JOUR.REP.01] Source: The student newspaper is preparing a story about a new cafeteria ordering system. A cafeteria manager says the goal is to shorten lunch lines. Two students say the app is confusing during the first week. A technology assistant says the school will post a how-to guide by Friday. The reporter has not yet confirmed how many students have used the app or whether the line wait time has changed. Question 1: Which action best strengthens the reporting plan? {
